Real-host checks for the Codex wrapper. They run only through the phase 20
harness: fake model on localhost, network blocked, throwaway HOME.

  python3 -I harness/harness.py --host codex --integration codex …

Pass-through, decoder and capability unit tests run offline in `pnpm test`
and `node tools/cargo.mjs test`. Functional bursts, soak, native UI, terminals
and speed need a pinned Codex in the harness cache and are skipped here when
that host is missing.
